summary:
  A disk probe asked for the previous recording is taken as the answer for
  the one that just started.

history:
  Stop and press REC again inside a second and the old probe's "it exists"
  lands after the new recording began. Taken at its word, the new counter
  runs while nothing of the new file is on disk.

target:
  package/contents/ui/RecordingEngine.qml

find:
              if (probeGen !== _recGen) return true;

replace:
              if (isNaN(probeGen)) return true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_recordingengine.qml::test_an_answer_about_the_previous_recording_is_dropped.
  Line-neutral.
